<Base title="Start Here | The Founder Edit" description="What The Founder Edit is, who writes it, and where to begin: Season 1 — The Things I Was Wrong About." current="start">
  <section class="opener"><p class="kicker">Start here</p><h1>I ran the startup. Now I'm running the edit.</h1><p class="lede">I'm Wen — founder of SushiVid, accidental entrepreneur. For ten years I told the polished version of my story. This channel is the honest cut: what I believed, what actually happened, and what I only understood afterwards.</p><p class="lede">No frameworks. No five key takeaways. Just a founder going back over her own footage.</p></section><section class="season"><p class="kicker">Season one</p><h2>The Things I Was Wrong About</h2><p class="season-intro">Every episode is one assumption I carried into my founder life, and the moment it met reality. They're discoveries, not lessons — I'm still inside some of them.</p><ol class="episodes"><li><span class="ep-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span><div class="ep-text"><p class="ep-wrong">Wrong about: Success</p><h3>I thought life would reward the plan</h3><p class="ep-line">Beauty, marriage, career — I had the checklist. Life had other ideas.</p></div><span class="ep-status">Coming soon</span></li><li><span class="ep-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span><div class="ep-text"><p class="ep-wrong">Wrong about: Time</p><h3>I thought hard work ran on a schedule</h3><p class="ep-line">Work hard, raise the round, exit. Nobody told me the clock was a liar.</p></div><span class="ep-status">Coming soon</span></li><li><span class="ep-num" aria-hidden="true">03</span><div class="ep-text"><p class="ep-wrong">Wrong about: People</p><h3>The dream kept getting smaller</h3><p class="ep-line">I built SushiVid believing everyone was as hungry as me. They were not me.</p></div><span class="ep-status">Coming soon</span></li></ol></section><section class="meanwhile"><p class="kicker">While you wait</p><h2>The archive is already honest</h2><p>I've been writing since 2021 — through the health scare, the therapy, the year I fought to save the business. <a href="/">Start with the writing</a>, or read <a href="/my-startup-journey-and-its-negative-impact-on-my-health/">the post that started it all</a>.</p><p class="follow">Follow along on <a href="https://instagram.com/yuhwenfoong" rel="me noopener">Instagram</a> or subscribe by <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a> — new episodes land here first as essays.</p></section>
</Base>

